                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Daudi yaagarukayo kushabira ab'omu ka ye omugisha. Mikaali muhara wa Saulo yaashohora kubugana Daudi, yaagira ati: Eshi eri izooba omugabe wa Israeli yaagira ekitiinisa, obu yaaba naayejwekyera busha omu maisho g'abazaana b'abairu be, nk'omuntu otaine ku ari oku ayejweka busha ataine nshoni! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
